                            <comment id="455551" author="adilger" created="Sat, 10 May 2025 13:17:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18934&quot; title=&quot;report OST IO latency stats by IO size&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-18934&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18934&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for similar work that is in progress on the server side. &lt;/p&gt;

